  "limitations": [
    "The guide predicts operator and lambda priors used to reorder symbolic enumeration; it is not a program-output oracle.",
    "The program-length head predicts classes 1–6 and contributes a weighted auxiliary loss to the shared encoder during training. Its output is returned by predict_priors but is discarded by the released search runtime; it does not schedule search or affect benchmark search order.",
    "No controlled length-head ablation has established whether auxiliary length supervision improves operator/lambda representations or synthesis outcomes.",
    "Search remains symbolic and branch-preserving; operator/lambda scores reorder enumeration but do not prune valid branches.",
    "The legacy tree candidate-scoring branch is not used by v3 prior prediction and is not optimized by this training objective."
  ],
